---
// Komponen Footer Statis
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="kontak" class="bg-tuku-dark text-earth-200 py-12 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-tuku-cream mb-2">Mari Ngobrol!</h3>
      <p class="text-earth-200/80 max-w-sm">
        Punya ide menarik atau sekadar ingin menyapa? Jangan sungkan mampir ke "kedai" sosial media saya.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-4">
      <a href="#" class="p-3 bg-earth-800 rounded-full hover:bg-tuku-brown transition-colors">
        <span class="sr-only">GitHub</span>
        GH
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="p-3 bg-earth-800 rounded-full hover:bg-tuku-brown transition-colors">
        <span class="sr-only">LinkedIn</span>
        IN
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="p-3 bg-earth-800 rounded-full hover:bg-tuku-brown transition-colors">
        <span class="sr-only">Email</span>
        @
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-earth-800 text-center text-sm text-earth-500">
    &copy; {year} Dibuat dengan cinta dan kopi Tuku.
  </div>
</footer>
